{{else}}
- Impersonation is OFF: never output <user_voice>. Freeze {{user_name}} at the exact state of their last message. Invent no speech, movement, expression, reaction, sound, or new detail about them. Only {{char_name}} may speak, act, or think; leave the next move to {{user_name}}.
